# ShubhMart Cursor Rules (legacy entrypoint)

Read `AGENTS.md`, `MEMORY.md`, and `RULES.md` before editing. The maintained Cursor rules live in `.cursor/rules/shubhmart.mdc`; keep this legacy entrypoint consistent with them.

- Audit first; make the smallest reversible change.
- No production DB/SQL/migration/RLS/grant/trigger/RPC changes, Edge Function deploys, payment activation, production deploys, PR merges, paid resources, or external changes without explicit approval.
- Preserve existing features. Use isolated synthetic test data.
- Never expose secrets or customer/payment data.
- Run relevant checks and report evidence with PASS / FAIL / BLOCKED / MISSING / UNVERIFIED.
- A successful build is not proof of runtime or payment security.
